%N A087613 Number of labeled acyclic preferences/voting outcomes, indifference and undecidedness/incompleteness permitted (Social Choice Theory).
%H A087613 Victor Nidal Bassem Nagib, <a href="/A087613/b087613.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..50</a>
