%F A087613 a(n) = Sum_{k=1..n} (-1)^(k+1)*binomial(n,k)*2^(k*(k-1)/2)*3^(k*(n-k))*a(n-k), with a(0) = 1. - _Victor Nidal Bassem Nagib_, Oct 30 2026
